IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BALANCE-CALC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-BALANCE PIC S9(7).
01 WS-DEPOSIT PIC S9(7).
01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(8).
01 WS-OUT PIC Z(7)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ACCEPT WS-BALANCE.
    ACCEPT WS-DEPOSIT.

    IF WS-BALANCE < 0 OR WS-DEPOSIT < 0
        DISPLAY "INVALID AMOUNT"
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-TOTAL =
            WS-BALANCE + WS-DEPOSIT

        MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-OUT

        DISPLAY "Updated Balance: " WS-OUT
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
